{"format":"hologram.registry.artifact/v1","id":"docker.io/hashicorp/vault-csi-provider","fetched":"2026-09-25T12:08:33.086Z","source":{"name":"Docker Hub","api":"https://hub.docker.com/v2/repositories/hashicorp/vault-csi-provider/","page":"https://hub.docker.com/r/hashicorp/vault-csi-provider"},"readme":"# Vault CSI Provider\n\nThe `vault-csi-provider` provides first-class integration between Vault and the [CSI Secret Store Driver](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/secrets-store-csi-driver).\n\n## Features\n\n  * **Mounting secrets using volume mounts**\n  * **Syncing Vault secrets to Kubernetes secrets**\n  * **Requests secrets using the requestors Kubernetes service account**\n  * **Extracting one or more values from a secret**\n  * **TLS/mTLS communications with Vault**\n\n## Installation\n\nThe recommended installation method is the official [Vault Helm chart](https://github.com/hashicorp/vault-helm). \n\nSee the official [Vault Helm documentation](https://www.vaultproject.io/docs/platform/k8s/helm) for more information \non installing the Vault CSI Provider.","readmeBase":null,"publisher":{"name":"glenno","url":"https://hub.docker.com/u/hashicorp","official":false,"verified":false},"registered":"2021-03-18T20:49:14.205729Z","updated":"2026-08-07T05:40:58.362346Z","categories":["Security","Integration & delivery","Databases & storage"],"keywords":[],"license":null,"links":[],"maintainers":[],"stats":{"pulls":40645639,"stars":4},"mediaTypes":["application/vnd.docker.container.image.v1+json","application/vnd.docker.distribution.manifest.list.v2+json"],"contentTypes":["image"],"storage":2476765220,"tags":[{"name":"1.7.4","digest":"sha256:6510bbc21b3e39e3f201b726b60bd25ed06fddfb7c6bc044ffff17c5e9958d3c","pushed":"2026-08-07T05:40:57.864965Z","size":33757073,"platforms":["linux/amd64","linux/arm64","linux/386","linux/arm/v6"],"mediaType":"application/vnd.docker.distribution.manifest.list.v2+json","status":"active"},{"name":"1.7.4-ubi","digest":"sha256:2c9c8a5aa6b048